Console me!

I was not even 10th level when I found a wand of polymorph and turned
my dog Puddles into Deadsy the Lich. Deadsy was my most loyal
companion all the way down to the Amulet level, but I left him
upstairs so that I could use conflict on all the priests down there. I
knew I was taking a chance on losing his friendship, after so long a
time, but somehow I figured I wouldn't be long....

"Stay put, Deadsy, I'll be right back, I promise!"

I got back upstairs and discovered he'd become rather indifferent to
me... my greatest partner-in-crime had become nothing but a mere
acquaintance. I actually felt genuinely sad for the loss. I should
have turned down the cheap trick of that ring and brought my buddy
with me. There's a life lesson to be learned here.

Now I know what Frodo felt like.


